  "totalBlocks": 50,
  "translatedBlocks": 50,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d9659380a0ca76bc",
      "translationZh": "我们很高兴地宣布，Hugging Face Text Generation Inference (TGI) 现已在 AWS Inferentia2 和 Amazon SageMaker 上正式可用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4faa104415b03bc3",
      "translationZh": "Text Generation Inference (TGI) 是一款专门构建的解决方案，用于在大规模生产工作负载中部署大型语言模型（LLM）并提供推理服务。TGI 利用张量并行和连续批处理，为 Llama、Mistral 等最受欢迎的开放 LLM 实现高性能文本生成。Grammarly、Uber、Deutsche Telekom 等众多公司已在生产环境中使用 Text Generation Inference。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "edead8150ff70465",
      "translationZh": "将 TGI 集成到 Amazon SageMaker 中，并结合 AWS Inferentia2，可为构建生产级 LLM 应用提供强大的解决方案，也是 GPU 的可行替代方案。这种无缝集成使模型易于部署和维护，让 LLM 在广泛的生产用例中更易于使用，也更易于扩展。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a6fa25afb3e274de",
      "translationZh": "借助 Amazon SageMaker 上面向 AWS Inferentia2 的全新 TGI，AWS 客户可以利用支撑高并发、低延迟 LLM 体验的同类技术，这些体验包括 HuggingChat、OpenAssistant，以及 Hugging Face Hub 上面向 LLM 的 Serverless Endpoints。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "62938c768987183b",
      "translationZh": "使用 Amazon SageMaker 在 AWS Inferentia2 上部署 Zephyr 7B",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db40b1a610f7c787",
      "translationZh": "本教程展示了使用 Amazon SageMaker 在 AWS Inferentia2 上部署 Zephyr 7B 等前沿 LLM 是多么简单。Zephyr 是 mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1 的 7B 微调版本，采用直接偏好优化（DPO），在公开可用数据集和合成数据集的混合数据上训练而成，具体细节见技术报告。该模型根据 Apache 2.0 许可证发布，确保其可被广泛获取和使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c39758d5f4626c0",
      "translationZh": "我们将向你展示如何：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "173afa28f99f0c98",
      "translationZh": "设置开发环境",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7b332df7d12e7429",
      "translationZh": "获取 TGI Neuronx 镜像",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fdf6023690821245",
      "translationZh": "将 Zephyr 7B 部署到 Amazon SageMaker",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b291bfc3d1dffa1b",
      "translationZh": "运行推理并与模型聊天",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "21cdc0fbea5e12ee",
      "translationZh": "让我们开始吧。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a1ffaa859f334223",
      "translationZh": "1. 设置开发环境",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "89d9eeba93d7be59",
      "translationZh": "我们将使用 sagemaker python SDK 将 Zephyr 部署到 Amazon SageMaker。我们需要确保已配置 AWS 账户并安装了 sagemaker python SDK。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9daf13751d765a6c",
      "translationZh": "如果你打算在本地环境中使用 Sagemaker，你需要有权访问具备 Sagemaker 所需权限的 IAM 角色。你可以在此处了解更多相关信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2322481f304b19b5",
      "translationZh": "2. 获取 TGI Neuronx 镜像",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9c24a6046ddd2573",
      "translationZh": "新的 Hugging Face TGI Neuronx DLC 可用于在 AWS Inferentia2 上运行推理。你可以使用 sagemaker SDK 的 get_huggingface_llm_image_uri 方法，根据所需的后端、会话、区域和版本，获取相应的 Hugging Face TGI Neuronx DLC URI。你可以在此处找到所有可用版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "164d749197c1e157",
      "translationZh": "注意：在撰写这篇博文时，尚无法通过 get_huggingface_llm_image_uri 方法获取最新版本的 Hugging Face LLM DLC。我们将改为直接使用容器 URI。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5e2c6be2af8345c5",
      "translationZh": "4. 将 Zephyr 7B 部署到 Amazon SageMaker",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4fbd68dd5dae3aa8",
      "translationZh": "Inferentia2 上的 Text Generation Inference (TGI) 支持流行的开放 LLM，包括 Llama、Mistral 等。你可以在此处查看受支持模型的完整列表（text-generation）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb3de3806aca3925",
      "translationZh": "为 Inferentia2 编译 LLM",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35de50d796e65955",
      "translationZh": "在撰写本文时，AWS Inferentia2 尚不支持推理时的动态形状，这意味着我们需要提前指定序列长度和批大小。为了让客户更轻松地充分利用 Inferentia2 的能力，我们创建了一个 neuron 模型缓存，其中包含最流行的 LLM 的预编译配置。一个缓存配置由模型架构（Mistral）、模型大小（7B）、neuron 版本（2.16）、inferentia 核心数量（2）、批大小（2）和序列长度（2048）定义。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a98a04c6ecc1214b",
      "translationZh": "这意味着我们不需要自行编译模型，而是可以使用缓存中的预编译模型。例如 mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1 和 HuggingFaceH4/zephyr-7b-beta。你可以在 Hugging Face Hub 上找到已编译或已缓存的配置。如果你所需的配置尚未缓存，可以使用 Optimum CLI 自行编译，或在 Cache 仓库中提交请求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a13dc6fcf81b9b6",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，我们在一个 inf2.8xlarge 实例上使用以下命令和参数重新编译了 HuggingFaceH4/zephyr-7b-beta，并将其推送到 Hub 上的 aws-neuron/zephyr-7b-seqlen-2048-bs-4-cores-2。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ea50ae13787cf2a0",
      "translationZh": "如果你尝试使用尚未缓存的配置来编译 LLM，可能需要长达 45 分钟。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f59be5bab4cf2f49",
      "translationZh": "部署 TGI Neuronx 端点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8d68b5d9935f7b65",
      "translationZh": "在将模型部署到 Amazon SageMaker 之前，我们必须定义 TGI Neuronx 端点配置。我们需要确保已定义以下附加参数：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a57c9a94194eda66",
      "translationZh": "HF_NUM_CORES：编译时使用的 Neuron 核心数量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "52b08ab7d54582a9",
      "translationZh": "HF_BATCH_SIZE：编译模型时使用的批大小。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b03d86c1e91f2f78",
      "translationZh": "HF_SEQUENCE_LENGTH：编译模型时使用的序列长度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ab1024799dfe59da",
      "translationZh": "HF_AUTO_CAST_TYPE：编译模型时使用的自动类型转换类型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1aaf30d356710390",
      "translationZh": "我们仍需通过以下内容定义常规 TGI 参数：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "eaf758d72b6c9365",
      "translationZh": "HF_MODEL_ID：Hugging Face 模型 ID。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f4c30d8b6aea935a",
      "translationZh": "HF_TOKEN：用于访问受限模型的 Hugging Face API 令牌。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e4d16709f748da77",
      "translationZh": "MAX_BATCH_SIZE：模型能够处理的最大批量大小，等于编译时使用的批量大小。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "44e26b3997f79af8",
      "translationZh": "MAX_INPUT_LENGTH：模型能够处理的最大输入长度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bdd4464dadadea54",
      "translationZh": "MAX_TOTAL_TOKENS：模型能够生成的最大 token 总数，等于编译时使用的序列长度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ea4bf48aaa81babf",
      "translationZh": "创建 HuggingFaceModel 后，我们就可以使用 deploy 方法将其部署到 Amazon SageMaker。我们将使用 ml.inf2.8xlarge 实例类型部署模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b867a7b2443b6d56",
      "translationZh": "SageMaker 将创建我们的端点，并将模型部署到该端点。此过程可能需要 10-15 分钟。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0f58b066d60ae8c3",
      "translationZh": "5. 运行推理并与模型聊天",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2acaa3591b6632da",
      "translationZh": "端点部署完成后，我们就可以使用 predictor 的 predict 方法在该端点上运行推理。我们可以提供不同的参数来影响生成结果，将它们添加到 payload 的 parameters 属性中。你可以在这里找到受支持的参数，也可以在 swagger 文档中的 TGI 开放 API 规范中找到它们。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c51909fb4641221a",
      "translationZh": "HuggingFaceH4/zephyr-7b-beta 是一个对话聊天模型，这意味着我们可以使用如下提示词结构与它聊天：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9918695c946c60f9",
      "translationZh": "手动准备提示词容易出错，因此我们可以使用 tokenizer 的 apply_chat_template 方法来辅助完成。该方法接收一个采用广为人知的 OpenAI 格式的 messages 字典，并将其转换为适用于该模型的正确格式。让我们看看 Zephyr 是否了解一些关于 AWS 的知识。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4367bece15e2628d",
      "translationZh": "太棒了，我们已经成功将 Zephyr 部署到基于 Inferentia2 的 Amazon SageMaker 上，并与它进行了聊天。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ba47f919eaa8694c",
      "translationZh": "6. 清理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08a1ca358c19c5e3",
      "translationZh": "要进行清理，我们可以删除模型和端点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eebe2dc0be270d87",
      "translationZh": "将 Hugging Face Text Generation Inference (TGI) 与 AWS Inferentia2 和 Amazon SageMaker 集成，为部署大型语言模型 (LLMs) 提供了一种经济高效的替代方案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9482f2c74427fbc3",
      "translationZh": "我们正在积极推进对更多模型的支持、简化编译流程，并完善缓存系统。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d56adfaff91acdc",
      "translationZh": "感谢阅读！如有任何问题，欢迎通过 Twitter 或 LinkedIn 联系我。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
